* Upload structured (JSON) Half Marathon results with splits and runner status to RaceRoster (LPT).
*   Param 1 (%1):  The RaceRoster sub-event ID.
*   Param 2 (%2):  The race code for filtering (HALF).
*
*   Columns come from database fields, not raw events. Events2DB.rsm copies each
*   mat onto its field first, so a corrected or filtered value is what ships.
*   Run @CalcStatus.lst before uploading: it runs Events2DB and sets RUNNER STATUS.
*
*   Status event (Hide): RunScore only uploads a runner who has a time on some
*   event. The dummy Status event carries 0 for that purpose, so runners who
*   have not reached a mat still reach Race Roster. Seed it by simulating a race
*   on Status and typing @TIME 0. Race Roster ignores the Hide column.
*
*   Estimated Finish Time is the only pace Race Roster has for a STARTING
*   runner -- it plots them between the start and the first mat.
*
*   Split marks below (1K, 2K, 5K, 10K, 18K) are sample positions. Timers MUST
*   rename the events in Events.xml AND the matching lines here when their mats
*   differ.
*
*   Note:           LPT requires structured (JSON) results -- unstructured (text) uploads
*                   are not supported by Live Predictive Tracking.
*
*   Recommendation:
*     - Define sub-event IDs in Entries.INI (e.g. %rr_half%) rather than hardcoding
*       them here or in multiple listings -- one place to update when IDs change.
*     - Do not add List DNF: an empty cell means "not there yet", not a DNF.

External Report To  RaceRoster
Records Per Page    100000
No Page Numbers
Dq Field            DNF

Header
.INCLUDE            RACENAME.%2
##%1##
.End of Header

Select              BIB
>                   0
And
Select              DNF
EQ
And
Select              Race
=                   %2
Field               BIB
Field               Name
Field               Sex
Field               AGE
Field               DIV
Field               City
Field               State
Field               DIVPLACE
Field               DIVTOTAL
Field               SEXPLACE
Field               SEXTOTAL

* Include flag: dummy Status event (0). Race Roster does not show this column.
Event               Status
Field Header        Hide

Field               RUNNER STATUS
Field Header        Race Status

* Clock times of day
Field               CHIPSTART
Time Format         HH:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Start Chip Time Local

Field               Finish
Time Format         HH:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Finish Time Local

* Elapsed finish times (CalcPlaces writes these)
Field               TIME
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Gun Time

Field               NETTIME
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        Chip Time

* Course splits: cumulative elapsed from ChipStart
Event               Split1k
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        1K

Event               Split2K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        2K

Event               Split5K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        5K

Event               Split10K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        10K

Event               Split18K
minus               ChipStart
Time Format         H:MM:SS.01
Field Header        18K

* Predicted pace for runners who have not reached a mat yet
Field               Estimated
Time Format         HH:MM:SS
Field Header        Estimated Finish Time
